When the user asks whether a Kubernetes deployment/service is overprovisioned, right-sized, or
ready for resource optimization (CPU/memory requests, HPA, replicas, throttling, OOM, cost/waste),
read `k8s-overprovisioning-datadog/SKILL.md` and follow it.

